      "writtenOn": "2023-10-18T14:11:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When building Chrome, we can still use `ninja` and `autoninja` normally, and don\u0027t need to manually make calls to initialize reclient. GN does it for us. Can we have Skia work this way?",
